/T (It is my greatest pleasure to welcome you to the Social, Humanitarian and Cultural Committee \(SOCHUM\). My name is Seyram, and I am deeply honoured to serve as one of your Chairs for this committee. I am delighted to have the opportunity to guide you through this conference and create a space where everyone feels encouraged to participate, express their ideas, and engage in meaningful discussions. I encourage you to participate actively, respect diverse opinions, and engage in debates with confidence. I hope your time in SOCHUM is rewarding and memorable. I look forward to your ideas, your debates, and the solutions you will bring to the committee.)
