/T (Poverty, inequality, displacement, and limited education further place vulnerable groups, including refugees and youth in conflict-affected areas, at higher risk.)
/E (Poverty, inequality, displacement, and limited education further place vulnerable groups, including refugees and youth in conflict-affected areas, at higher risk.)
