/P 119 0 R
/E (Digital platforms can provide connection, education, and access to support, but can also expose young people to cyberbullying, harmful content, social comparison, and pressure to maintain idealised online identities. Delegates should examine the responsibilities of governments, technology companies, schools, parents, and users in creating safer digital environments while balancing online protection with privacy and freedom of expression.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
