<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 123 0 R
/T (In the modern era, globalization and migration have increased diversity but also introduced new challenges. Rising nationalism, misinformation, online hate speech, and political polarization have intensified discrimination in many societies. Minority groups, migrants, refugees, and religious communities are often disproportionately affected, facing barriers to safety, opportunity, and inclusion.)
/E (In the modern era, globalization and migration have increased diversity but also introduced new challenges. Rising nationalism, misinformation, online hate speech, and political polarization have intensified discrimination in many societies. Minority groups, migrants, refugees, and religious communities are often disproportionately affected, facing barriers to safety, opportunity, and inclusion.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8]
>>
