/P 125 0 R
/T (At the same time, governments and international organizations are strengthening policies to address these issues. Current efforts focus on anti-discrimination legislation, education, intercultural and interreligious dialogue, protection of minorities, responsible digital governance and promoting social inclusion. However, significant gaps remain, particularly in protecting marginalized communities and ensuring that laws and policies are effectively implemented. )
/E (At the same time, governments and international organizations are strengthening policies to address these issues. Current efforts focus on anti-discrimination legislation, education, intercultural and interreligious dialogue, protection of minorities, responsible digital governance and promoting social inclusion. However, significant gaps remain, particularly in protecting marginalized communities and ensuring that laws and policies are effectively implemented. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
