1097 0 obj
<<
/Title (It is with great joy and pleasure that we welcome you to the Social, Humanitarian and Cultural Committee \(SOCHUM\) at DPSIMUN 2026. This year, our committee will focus on two of many global issues:)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 704 0 R
/Prev 942 0 R
/Next 1255 0 R
>>
endobj
1098 0 obj
<<
/Title (These topics reflect a broader concern with building resilient, inclusive societies that are capable of protecting human dignity and social cohesion during periods of instability and uncertainty. As delegates, you would be expected to move beyond simply identifying the existence of these problems and instead develop practical, inclusive and sustainable policy solutions that strengthen societies before, during and after periods of crisis and turmoil.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 704 0 R
/Prev 1256 0 R
/Next 943 0 R
>>
endobj
1099 0 obj
<<
/Title (Emmanuela Frimpong   CHAIR)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 944 0 R
/Next 1257 0 R
>>
endobj
1100 0 obj
<<
/Title (It is my greatest pleasure to welcome you to the Social, Humanitarian and Cultural Committee \(SOCHUM\). My name is Seyram, and I am deeply honoured to serve as one of your Chairs for this committee. I am delighted to have the opportunity to guide you through this conference and create a space where everyone feels encouraged to participate, express their ideas, and engage in meaningful discussions. I encourage you to participate actively, respect diverse opinions, and engage in debates with confidence. I hope your time in SOCHUM is rewarding and memorable. I look forward to your ideas, your debates, and the solutions you will bring to the committee.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 944 0 R
/Prev 1258 0 R
>>
endobj
