<<
/Title (Addressing these challenges requires both legal and social action. Education is essential in promoting tolerance, reducing stereotypes, and fostering respect for diversity. Governments, international organizations, and civil society must work together to strengthen protections, prevent hate speech, and ensure equal participation for marginalized groups.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1102 0 R
/Next 1349 0 R
>>
